## 6. Prompt: Why is this table worth adding to the MSDM project?

### Prompt

**Explain why the table is worth adding to your MSDM project written report or presentation slides.**

### Response

This table is worth adding because it turns several related KPIs into a single presentation-ready exhibit. For a written report, it gives the reader exact values that can be referenced in the discussion. For presentation slides, the embedded sparkline makes the exhibit more visual while preserving the numeric detail needed to support a claim.

Most importantly, the table supports a decision-oriented conversation. A stakeholder can ask which category contributes the most revenue, whether the category rankings are consistent with sales volume, and whether revenue appears stable or variable across the year. Those questions can be answered directly from one exhibit rather than from several disconnected outputs.

