### Interpretation reminder

This demonstration uses the built-in `pizzaplace` data because the CEP dataset was not supplied here. Before submitting a final CEP version, replace `pizzaplace` with the project dataset and revise the selected variables so the table directly matches the project's Analytics Objectives.
:::

